# Input

```vue
<!DOCTYPE html>
<template>
  <div>The doctype keeps its case outside of a plain HTML file.</div>
</template>

```


# Formatted

```vue
<!DOCTYPE html>
<template>
	<div>The doctype keeps its case outside of a plain HTML file.</div>
</template>

```
